      "id": "water-edge",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "p",
      "source-layer": "water",
      "_note": "Narrow water drawn a little wider than it is, as a printed map does — the moat is a string of slivers, and the bank roads cover it at its true width.",
      "filter": [
